## Moving affine companion gauge

For the homogeneous affine lift, set

```text
K_tilde(a)=[[K(a),b(a)],[0,0]],
B_aff(a)=[e_aff,K_tilde(a)e_aff,...,K_tilde(a)^1509 e_aff].
```

On the cyclic domain, `B_aff(a)` is invertible and defines

```text
C_aff(a)     = B_aff(a)^-1 K_tilde(a) B_aff(a),
Omega_aff(a) = B_aff(a)^-1 dB_aff(a)/da.
```

Both are rational over `k(a)`. The first is the pointwise companion matrix;
the second is the moving-frame connection. If the selected path equation is

```text
